  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome, wait for the
      title screen to finish loading, then click.
      No server, no flags. ESC leaves fullscreen.
      A discrete GPU is recommended. Tested on an RTX 5090.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how it is made
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      - one raymarching fragment shader for all scenes
      - one distance function for Clawd, used as hero, crowd,
        recursion and as the mask of the final formation
      - the zoom into the eye is exact: three nested levels are
        rendered each frame around the fixed point of the map
      - light shafts, plasma, a tunnel, a glitch: the classics
      - the soundtrack is a fragment shader: one pixel per
        sample, 48 kHz, 125 BPM, rendered once and read back
      - packed with Roadroller and zopfli into an HTML comment and
        unpacked by DecompressionStream, so it runs from file://

      Source, build tools and notes are in this folder; see
      readme.md.

